<title>PORTUGAL: Somague cleared to buy Assiconstroi.</title>
<headline>Somague cleared to buy Assiconstroi.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese construction firm Somague-SGPS has obtained authorisation from the Directorate-General of Competition and Prices to acquire 100 percent of the capital of Assiconstroi, a unit of builder A.Silva &amp; Silva, Somague's vice president said.</p>
<p>&quot;On March 31 an order from the Directorate General authorised the purchase of Assiconstroi,&quot; Diogo Vaz Guedes told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said his company's 1996 results would be released next week.</p>
<p>Somague recently acquired Assiconstroi for 10.3 billion escudos.</p>
